  "tick_processing_order": {
    "description": "Per-NPC per-tick execution order in KNpc::Activate()",
    "order": [
      "1. Check m_bExchangeServer -> skip if transferring",
      "2. Increment m_LoopFrames++",
      "3. Process CC states (poison, freeze, burn, frozen, randmove, stun, life/mana regen, losemana) -> may block ProcStatus",
      "4. Natural HP/MP/Stamina regen (every GAME_UPDATE_TIME=10 ticks, blocked during stun)",
      "5. ProcStatus() -> switch(m_Doing) -> call OnXxx() handler",
      "6. OnXxx() calls WaitForFrame()/IsReachFrame() -> advance frame counter -> trigger effects -> state transition",
      "7. AI processing (if m_ProcessAI == 1)"
    ]
  }
